      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "text": "W3 — FINALIZE + POSE + REFERENCE VIEWS\n(Sections 8, 9, 10)\n\nRequired custom nodes (install via ComfyUI Manager):\n  - ComfyUI_IPAdapter_plus  (by cubiq)\n  - comfyui_controlnet_aux  (by Fannovel16)\n\nWorkflow:\n  1. Set 'Locked Character Reference' to your W2 output image.\n  2. Set 'Pose Reference' to a 3d.sk photo matching the view you want.\n  3. Adjust the positive prompt for the specific view/lighting:\n     - Canonical: 'neutral A-pose, front view, even studio lighting'\n     - Side view: '90-degree side view, neutral pose, studio lighting'\n     - 3/4 view: 'three-quarter view, relaxed pose, soft key light'\n     - Back view: 'rear view, neutral A-pose, even studio lighting'\n     - Dramatic: 'front view, dramatic split lighting, deep shadows'\n  4. Fix seed for reproducibility. Change seed between runs for variation.\n  5. Increase batch_size in EmptyLatentImage for multiple outputs per run.\n  6. Depth ControlNet is optional — bypass nodes 24-26 to save VRAM.\n\nOutput folder: [ComfyUI output]/canonical/\n\nPrompt templates for Section 10 lighting presets:\n  neutral_studio: 'even studio lighting, soft fill, no harsh shadows'\n  soft_key:       'soft key light from 45 degrees, gentle fill'\n  rim_light:      'rim lighting from behind, subtle fill from front'\n  dramatic_split: 'dramatic split lighting, deep shadows on one side'\n  outdoor:        'overcast outdoor lighting, soft diffused light'"
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [800, 740],
      "size": {"0": 340, "1": 140},
      "flags": {},
      "order": 24,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "text": "IPAdapterFaceID weights (same as W2):\n  weight (0.85) = face identity strength\n  weight_v2 (1.0) = global image influence\n  end_at (1.0) = active full denoising\n\nIf face fights the pose, try end_at=0.75"
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [1200, 740],
      "size": {"0": 340, "1": 120},
      "flags": {},
      "order": 25,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "text": "Body IP-Adapter (same as W2):\n  weight (0.4) = body appearance nudge\n  end_at (0.75) = stop early, let pose win\n\n  Lower weight if pose is being ignored.\n  This node is optional — bypass to disable."
