      "order": 26,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "text": "SECTION 9 — POSE VARIANT RUNS\n\nFor each pose variant (standing, sitting, walking, etc.):\n  1. Swap the Pose Reference image to the 3d.sk photo\n     matching that pose\n  2. Adjust positive prompt for the pose description\n  3. Keep seed fixed for comparability across poses\n  4. Save each with descriptive prefix:\n     canonical/standing, canonical/sitting, etc.\n\nThe identity stack (FaceID + Body IP-Adapter) ensures\nface and proportions remain locked across all poses."
      }
    },

